# Generation input for the Kotlin top-level constant fixture (features/10
# field form). The caller supplies -D kotlin-output=<dir>; this file is
# otherwise the complete generation input.
#
# Run from the worktree root:
#   haxe tests/haxe/kotlin-toplevel-const/kotlin.hxml -D kotlin-output=<dir>
#
# "-cp packages/compiler" names this tree's emitter explicitly. "-lib boring"
# resolves through the workspace haxelib projection, which in this workspace
# points into another worktree (PIT-376), and the fixture would then judge a
# tree other than the one under test. "samples" supplies the std shim modules
# the emitter forces into typing (std.UStringException and the Fs faults).
-lib reflaxe
-cp packages/compiler
-cp packages/compiler/reflaxe/kotlin/std-shadow
-cp packages/compiler/reflaxe/kotlin
-cp tests/haxe/kotlin-toplevel-const
-cp samples
--macro Intercept.run(['samples', 'tests/haxe/kotlin-toplevel-const'])
--macro kotlincompiler.Compiler.use()
toplevelconst.MarkedConsts
toplevelconst.UnmarkedConsts
toplevelconst.consumer.ConstConsumer
